        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to Atria. The Great City of Pando has been thrust into chaos. Religious ideology runs rampant, fueled by the terrifying prophecy of The Ember Oracle, a figure believed to herald the city's destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Sin-Nul, a fire Vita caught between his own fate and the radical influence of the Ever Flame. Journey with him through the sprawling districts of Pando, plunged into a desperate struggle of faith and fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignite your inner flame in <i>Vita: The Ember Oracle</i>, the third chapter in the <i>Vita</i> saga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862710/extras/ac194c424b1970e8e9cbb8d9196de403.avif?t=1782358586\" width=495 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862710/extras/f999900e806d45592cd4982728ed850e.webp?t=1782358586\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined Duel-Resource Turn-Based Battle System (DRTBS):</strong> Master a strategic combat system designed for depth and tactical decision-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Progression:</strong> Earn skill points during battle to unlock new skills and dominate your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergistic Loadouts:</strong> Craft the perfect team composition with deep character customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Party Switching:</strong> Adapt to the flow of battle by swapping party members mid-combat to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Pando:</strong> Journey through four unique regions, each inspired by distinct Late Middle Age European cultures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Updated Visuals:</strong> Experience the world of Atria with enhanced graphics that breathe new life into every environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realized Character Portraits:</strong> Connect with your cast through beautifully rendered, expressive character portraits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862710/extras/6ce85e1e9825d4041ef035c4654a1288.avif?t=1782358586\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862710/extras/f999900e806d45592cd4982728ed850e.webp?t=1782358586\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Play Vita: The Ember Oracle?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An RPG with Soul:</strong> <i>The Ember Oracle</i> is a labor of love, crafted to capture the essence of the classic adventures we grew up with. Experience a story that holds a mirror to our own history and cultures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Rooted in Reality:</strong> Pando is more than a fantasy backdrop; it is a city meticulously inspired by the architecture and cultures of the European Late Middle Ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat:</strong> Loadouts keep fights tight and strategic. Success requires understanding each role and swapping characters as needed, keeping battles engaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Respect for Your Time:</strong> The <i>Vita</i> series is built for the modern player. We deliver focused, high-impact RPG experiences that get to the point, allowing you to enjoy a complete, meaningful story without the endless grind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Solo-Developed Passion Project:</strong> This series isn't about one-off games—it's about building a living, breathing world. Every detail in <i>The Ember Oracle</i> is hand-crafted with a deep appreciation for the art of game design.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862710/extras/100ce330033d8609728d37ed7deabd66.avif?t=1782358586\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
